UID:ev_30a_thanksgiving_day_races_1126-2026-11-26@coastaleventures.com
DTSTAMP:20261126T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261126
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261127
SUMMARY:30A Thanksgiving Day Races: 10K\, 5K and 1 mile
LOCATION:Rosemary Beach\, start and finish on East Water Street\, 28 N Barr
 ett Square\, Rosemary Beach\, FL 32461
DESCRIPTION:Thursday 11/26 · 10K 7:30 AM\, 1 mile 7:35 AM\, 5K 9:30 AM\n\n
 The 15th 30A Thanksgiving Day Races start and finish on East Water Street 
 in Rosemary Beach\, with a 10K at 7:30 AM\, a 1 mile fun run at 7:35 AM an
 d a 5K at 9:30 AM. The 10K is open to ages 6 and up\, and the post-race pa
 rty in Barrett Square has breakfast\, a DJ\, local vendors and a mimosa an
 d Bloody Mary bar. The series has raised more than $1 million for local ch
 arities.\n\nPrice: from $45\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/event
 s/ev-30a-thanksgiving-day-races-1126.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-30a-thanksgiving-day-races-1126.
 html
CATEGORIES:Events and festivals
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
