DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261213
SUMMARY:Adventure Zone at Steve's Fishing and Adventure Farm
LOCATION:Steve's Fishing and Adventure Farm\, 1201 S Highway 99\, Walnut Hi
 ll\, FL 32568
DESCRIPTION:Mon-Sat through Dec 12 · weekdays 12 PM to 5 PM and Saturdays 
 9 AM to 5 PM from Nov 20\n\nSteve's Farm has rebranded as Steve's Fishing 
 and Adventure Farm and opened a fall attraction in Walnut Hill with a corn
  maze\, a giant slide\, a kids' zipline\, a jump pad\, hayrides\, a wagon 
 train\, a sunflower field and a pumpkin patch. It suits a family with smal
 l children who want a half day outdoors. The farm's ticket page lists day 
 passes at $15.00 to $19.45 and a $35 season pass\, so check it for each da
 y's hours before driving out.\n\nPrice: from $19.45\n\nDetails: https://co
 astaleventures.com/events/ev-steves-farm-adventure-zone-0929.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-steves-farm-adventure-zone-0929.
 html
