LOCATION:The Wharf\, 23101 Canal Road\, Orange Beach\, AL 36561
DESCRIPTION:Daily from 11/13 · hours vary by day\n\nThe Wharf in Orange Be
 ach opens a real ice rink for the holiday season on November 13 and keeps 
 it open through January 18. Skates are provided\, beginners are welcome\, 
 and a DJ plays Friday and Saturday nights from 7:00 PM to 10:00 PM. On Tue
 sdays through December 8 the Wharf donates $5 to Toys for Tots for each sk
 ate purchase.\n\nPrice: from $16\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/
 events/ev-wharf-ice-rink-1113.html
