 e shop calls it a family-friendly space. Players get promo cards or specia
 l items while supplies last\, and a free Pokémon account is needed to qua
 lify (children under 13 register under a parent's account).\n\nPrice: Free
 \n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-pokemon-league-at-game
